  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có hai điểm phân biệt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>E</mi></semantics></math> thuộc mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên đường thẳng này nằm trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>F</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>F</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3d4866b6e7335289fea3d18221cd98a1157e9561a7f4a803457ac46ea052d587.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
